      "comment": "COURAGOUS LIL (1) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 18.01 to score two back then following on with a 18.10 win over 312m at this track. Recorded strong figures recently and rates on top again. EXTRA PINEAPPLE (2) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a one length second (22.69) in a Grade 5 /MDN. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. MISTER EASY (3) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at this track over 383m (22.37). Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Deserves plenty of respect. LITTLE NIFTY (7) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
